    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the Market \r\n\r\n2 x 2 Bedroom Self-Contained Apartments For Sale\r\nNo. 19A & 19B Altbawn Crescent, Kiltimagh, Co. Mayo\r\nFully Furnished | Investment Opportunity | BER D2\r\nPrice - €210,000 each per apartment  \r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this excellent investment opportunity comprising two self-contained two-bedroom apartments located in a central and well-established residential area of Kiltimagh.\r\n\r\nThe properties are currently rented and generating a combined annual rental income of €15,360 per annum, making this an attractive turnkey investment.\r\n\r\nApartment Details\r\nNo. 19A – Ground Floor Apartment\r\nTwo-bedroom unit\r\nApprox. 64.65 sq.m\r\nSeparate entrance\r\nKitchen / sitting room\r\nBathroom\r\nHallway\r\nRear garden\r\nBer 108539172\r\n\r\nNo. 19B – First Floor Apartment \r\nTwo-bedroom unit\r\nApprox. 73 sq.m\r\nSeparate entrance\r\nHallway, stairwell & landing\r\nKitchen / sitting room\r\nBathroom\r\nBer 108539172\r\n\r\nAdditional Features\r\nFully furnished and decorated\r\nAll main public services connected\r\n(water, electricity, telephone/broadband, town sewerage)\r\nPublic lighting & footpaths\r\nCentral location within walking distance of town amenities\r\n\r\nBER: d2\r\nGuide Price: €210,000 each per apartment O.N.O.\r\n\r\nAn ideal opportunity for investors seeking a ready-made income-producing property in a strong rental area.\r\n\r\nFor further information contact sole agents:\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\r\n086 2130723 | 094 9362216\r\n\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\r\n\r\n Disclaimer: These particulars, including measurements, floor areas and property size, are for guidance only and may contain errors. They are not part of any contract. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided"
      },
